<title>SINGAPORE: Low Keng Huat unit acquires all of Everett.</title>
<headline>Low Keng Huat unit acquires all of Everett.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction group Low Keng Huat (Singapore) said on Monday its wholly-owned subsidiary Kwan Hwee Investment has acquired 49 percent of Everett Investment Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>Kwan Hwee already owned the other 51 percent.</p>
<p>Low Keng Huat said an a statement that the 49 percent of Everett's issued capital was acquired for a cash consideration to Triad Investments of Singapore $2.98 million.</p>
<p>Everett owns the Duxton, a 49-room upmarket boutique hotel in Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
